### Key Achievements:

1. ✅ **Hero** - Background image now displays with dark overlay
2. ✅ **Features** - Subtitle displays, description is single text (not bullets)
3. ✅ **About** - Stats array displays in grid format
4. ✅ **Gallery** - Subtitle displays, captions mapped
