8. ✅ **Admin Footer Editor** - Completely rewritten to match new structure

### Data Flow:

```
Backend (MongoDB) 
    ↓
Tambo AI (generates sections)
    ↓
Admin Client (manual edits)
    ↓
Backend API (saves/serves data)
    ↓
Data Mapper (transforms field names)
    ↓
Website Client Components (displays)
    ↓
User sees rendered website
```

